    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24437" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦν . . πίονα δημῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.750
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				538
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				40
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίπλακι δημῷ</span> (of
			sacrificial meat) <i>with fat</i> above <i>and fat</i> below,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.243
			</span></i>; of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορέει κύνας ἠδ᾽ οἰωνοὺς δημῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.380
				</span></i>
			.</div>
